---
description: Domain modeling rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Main domain objects:

- Money
- Wallet
- WagerTransaction
- WalletLedgerEntry
- InboxMessage
- OutboxMessage

- Follow the domain model defined by the technical challenge.
- Use private/protected constructors and static factories.
- Use `rehydrate` factories for persistence reconstruction.
- Rehydration must not reapply business transition rules.
- Domain entities must not depend on NestJS or ORM decorators.
- Keep invariants inside the domain model.